      "name": "[Remielle] Voidwing Pilgrimage",
      "desc": "When Remielle is in the <color=#FFFFFF>Phase Flow</color> state, if her Auto-Attack's Finishing Move hits a target afflicted with <color=#FE437E>Ether Attribute Anomaly</color>, <color=#2EB6FF>Electric Attribute Anomaly</color>, <color=#FF5521>Fire Attribute Anomaly</color>, <color=#F0D12B>Physical Attribute Anomaly</color>, <color=#98EFF0>Ice Attribute Anomaly</color>, or <color=#A6C5FD>Wind Attribute Anomaly</color>, she <color=#2BAD00>triggers an additional instance of Abloom</color>, dealing a fixed 220% multiplier of the corresponding Attribute Anomaly DMG.",
